{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>GeoQuake 將全球地震報告集中在同一個即時地圖上，並在住處附近發生地震時發出通知。適合經常關注地震動態、需要快速掌握震央位置與規模的使用者。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-225.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>即時地震地圖與鄰近通知</h2>\n<p>App 在地圖上標示過去 24 小時或自選日期的地震，以顏色與大小反映規模，並突顯最新與最強一次。你可自訂 50 至 2,000 公里的警報距離與最低規模，App 關閉後仍能在背景接收通知，也可選擇全球 M6+ 強震提示。列表與統計支援按時間、規模或距離排序。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-269-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-270-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-271-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-272-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-273-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：GeoQuake: Earthquake Alerts</li><li>應用類別：Weather</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/geoquake-earthquake-alerts/id1529783642?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T22:24:23.178526+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":299,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T22:16:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T21:32:21.661769+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T22:17:50.661461+00:00","content_hash":"3c8031d058b515509ce7f488c63cc5ab10797cd10f240429bbc6863f23a0ea7d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}